  _keywordName: Beatrice's Autopsy
  _description: "Beatrice Sterling, F/47\n\nMultiple stab wounds identified across
    the face, neck, chest, and abdomen, with significant haemorrhaging indicating
    the victim was alive throughout the assault. Wound patterns suggest a minimum
    of eight separate strikes from a single-edged blade. Lividity is fixed and consistent
    with the body's discovered position in the bedroom doorway, confirming no post-mortem
    movement. Time of death estimated 5:00\u20136:00 PM."
